          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ফিনাইল — phināil — \"phenyl (a floor disinfectant)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আমি জলে ফিনাইল মিশিয়ে মেঝে মুছলাম। Āmi jôle phināil mishiye mejhe muchhlām. I mixed phenyl into the water and mopped the floor."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ফিনাইল (phināil) is borrowed from English phenyl, the name of a disinfectant used for washing floors."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
